Ran the genuine EBT energy-as-generator training directly on the recovered
dual-3090 rig (both GPUs back after USB4 reseat), bypassing the conductor's
flaky subprocess that twice blocked on env faults (inodes, then cuda=False).

RESULT (results/thesis_a_direct_definitive_run.json):
  thesis_a_part_a_PASS — tiny 38M byte-EBT trained STABLY 800 steps on GSM8K
  (no NaN/divergence, gradnorm bounded) AND learned a generalizing held-out
  energy landscape: margin 0.723 vs untrained 0.084 (~8.6x). AR sanity: held-out
  CE 5.71->1.55. Reuses the conductor's own model/train code (experiment_3734).

This CORRECTS the .341 false-negative ("bounded at small scale") which was an
inode-corrupted run, not a real result. Honest scope: decides part-(a) only
(stability + held-out energy learning). Part-(b) — matched-COMPUTE EBT-generation
-vs-AR reasoning accuracy — is DEFERRED: this EBT outputs embeddings, so a faithful
generation comparison needs an embedding->token decoder + larger scale (next
milestone). No reasoning-accuracy claim is made. Invariants untouched (paper_ready,
frozen 0.9131, P0.1 honest-negative).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
